{
  "title": "How to choose the right urinal screen",
  "excerpt": "Five steps to the screen that fits your restroom.",
  "imageAlt": "Blue ëkcoscreen urinal screen with anti-splash bristles, seen from above on a black background",
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "intro",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "introa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A restroom should look clean and smell fresh every day. The urinal screen is a small detail that makes a big difference. The right screen keeps the urinal fresh, reduces splashback onto the floor and walls, and saves cleaning time. These five steps help you choose it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "h2-traffic",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "h2-traffica",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How busy is your restroom?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "p-traffic-1",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "p-traffic-1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Start with traffic. The more visitors, the more the screen has to handle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "p-traffic-high",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "p-traffic-higha",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "High-traffic locations such as restaurants, bars, airports, and shopping malls: choose ëkcoscreen 60+ or xcrën HD 60+. They offer 60+ days of fragrance and dense anti-splash bristles. ëkcoscreen 60+ costs about the same per day as a 30-day screen. Choose xcrën HD 60+ when the look of the restroom matters too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "p-traffic-standard",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "p-traffic-standarda",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For standard traffic with monthly maintenance, powër screen provides up to 30 days of fragrance with patented anti-splash bristles. Made for monthly changes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "p-traffic-budget",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "p-traffic-budgeta",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Budget options üro lite and basic scrëen contain less material, so they cost less and their fragrance is lighter. üro lite still has long patented anti-splash bristles. basic scrëen protects the drain from debris but has no anti-splash bristles."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "h2-splash",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "h2-splasha",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Splash protection: less splashback, less cleaning"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "p-splash-1",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "p-splash-1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Urine that splashes outside the urinal is unpleasant for visitors and means more cleaning. Dense bristles catch the stream and keep the area around the urinal cleaner. ëkcoscreen 60+, xcrën HD 60+, powër screen and üro lite use Sealed Bristles Technology™, our patented anti-splash system."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
