          "_key": "p-frag-longa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Screens release their fragrance gradually. Most screens last up to 30 days and are changed every month. ëkcoscreen 60+ and xcrën HD 60+ last 60+ days, twice as long as standard 30-day screens, and even longer in low-traffic restrooms."
