          "text": "Biodegradable in landfill with Eco-One™: 93% biodegradation within 3.5 years in an independent laboratory test, tested under ASTM D5511 and ISO 15985 at the Instituto Politécnico Nacional in Mexico City. The same material without the additive showed 0%. Up to 99% is projected within 5 years."
